                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The rhyming gets old very fast, there are multiple spelling mistakes in the diary, the blocky pixel art doesn't go well with some higher resolution assets, the puzzles are stupidly easy (though I found the frog part to be unintuitive), the hardest part is finding the exits and that hoverbike part near the end. Were people in 2017 so starved for P&Cs to justify those good reviews? Also the game is EXTREMELY short, finished it in 84 minutes.",
